                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <div style="color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-body);">"The lift jerk issue in Tower B was resolved quickly. Being able to track status using just my Complaint ID is super convenient."</p>
                <div class="user-meta">
                    <div class="user-avatar" style="background: #FEF3C7; color: #D97706;">PS</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong style="font-size: 0.95rem; display: block;">Priya Singh</strong>
                        <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Tower B - Flat 105</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <div style="color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-body);">"No password hassles or account setups required. Just enter flat details, submit complaint, and track status anytime!"</p>
                <div class="user-meta">
                    <div class="user-avatar" style="background: #EDE9FE; color: #7C3AED;">AK</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong style="font-size: 0.95rem; display: block;">Arun Kumar</strong>
                        <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Tower C - Flat 704</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 7. STATISTICS COUNTER -->
<div class="container">
    <div class="stats-banner">
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>99.4%</h3>
                <p>Complaints Resolved</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>500+</h3>
                <p>Connected Units</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>35</h3>
                <p>Dedicated Staff</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>< 4 Hrs</h3>
                <p>Avg. Response Time</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- 8. CONTACT & MAP SECTION -->
<section id="contact" style="padding: 4rem 0 6rem; background: var(--bg);">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Contact Society Office</h2>
            <p>Get in touch with Skyline Residency Facility Management Committee.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="contact-grid">
            <div class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--primary);"><i class="fas fa-building" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i> Office Details</h3>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                        <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt" style="color: var(--secondary); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 4px;"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Residency Location</strong>
                            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Tower A Ground Floor, Skyline Residency Boulevard Road, Hi-Tech Sector 4</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                        <i class="fas fa-clock" style="color: var(--secondary); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 4px;"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Society Office Hours</strong>
                            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Monday – Saturday: 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM (Emergency Desk 24/7)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                        <i class="fas fa-phone-alt" style="color: var(--secondary); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 4px;"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Helpline Phone</strong>
                            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">+91 98765 43210 / +91 98765 43211</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope" style="color: var(--secondary); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 4px;"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Email Address</strong>
                            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">support@skylineresidency.com</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="map-container">
                <iframe title="Skyline Residency Location" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3806.302324701254!2d78.38084!3d17.44479!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb9158f201b205%3A0x11be71810c93540a!2sHITEC%20City%2C%20Hyderabad%2C%20Telangana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1700000000000!5m2!1sen!2sin" loading="lazy"></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
